<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thou art the sinner’s friend,</l><l>So I Thy friendship claim,</l><l>A sinner saved by grace,</l><l>When Thy sweet message came.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>My hardened heart was touched;</l><l>Thy pard’ning voice I heard;</l><l>And joy and peace came in</l><l>While list’ning to Thy word.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>So let me sing Thy praise,</l><l>So let me call Thee mine.</l><l>I cannot doubt Thy word,</l><l>I know that I am Thine.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
